/**
 * Resort directory behind /resorts/, /resorts/<park>/ and /resorts/<park>/<resort>/.
 *
 * resortDirectory.json is generated by scripts/import-resort-directory.mjs from the WE planner
 * database: names, parks, zones and room categories from "Wild Excursions — Resort & Room Category
 * Reference" (Oct 2026); address, coordinates and Google rating from Google Places (checked dates
 * are in the JSON). Location notes, highlights and websites are reused from tadobaResorts.ts /
 * penchResorts.ts, which were checked against each property's own site.
 * No prices, tiers or amenities here on purpose: the planner only has placeholders for those.
 */
